{"author":117,"label":"Kamadev Moharana","poems":[{"id":340,"source_language":"or","variants":{"or":{"label":"ଓଡ଼ିଆ","title":"ସେମାନେ କହୁଥିବା ଏକ ନଷ୍ଟ ସ୍ଵର୍ଗର ଫଟୋଚିତ୍ର","kind":"Original","stanzas":[["ଗୋବରୀ ପାଟର ଦକ୍ଷିଣ କୋଣରେ","ଦିଶୁଛି ଯେଉଁ ଚିଙ୍ଗୁଡ଼ି ଘେରି","କେଉଁକାଳୁ ଥିଲା ସେଠି","ଡରକୁଳି ନଈକୁ ଜଗି ବଣଟିଏ","ତା ଆରକଡକୁ ବେଣାକୁଦ","କୁଦ ଉପରେ ବରଗଛ","ଗଛ ତଳେ ଗ୍ରାମଦେବତୀ।"],["କେଜାଣି କିଏ ଗଢ଼ିଲା ସେଠି","ମାଟିର ମହାବେଦୀ!","ଥୋଇଲା ଟେଳାଟେଳା ବିଶ୍ୱାସ","ପଥରକୁ ଈଶ୍ୱରୀ କରି","ବାହୁବଳୀକୁ କଲା ନତଶୀର","ଗାଇଲା ନାଚିଲା ବନ୍ଧ ବାନ୍ଧି ପବନରେ","ରୁନ୍ଧିଲା ପଞ୍ଚଦ୍ୱାର।"],["ଏଇଠି ନ୍ୟାୟ-ନିଶାପ","ଭୋଜି-ଭାତ-ମଉଜ","ନାଚ ତାମସା ଘୋଡାନାଚ","ଗାଈଗୋଠ, ଧୋବାତୁଠ","ଡଙ୍ଗା-ଡୁଙ୍ଗି,ଚାନ୍ଦୁଆ ଜାଲ","ସଂଜେ ସକାଳେ","ହସ - ହତାଶାର ମୁହଁମାନ","ସତ- ମିଛର ଅସ୍ପଷ୍ଟ ଚିତ୍ରାଙ୍କନ","ପବନ ବଂଶୀସ୍ୱରରୁ","ପିଲାଏ ଶୁଣନ୍ତି ବାଇମନର ଜୀବନ","କୋଳକୋଳିରେ ମୁକୁଳେ ହୃଦୟ","ଏଇଠି ଗଣ୍ଠିପଡେ ମନ ସହିତ ମନ।"],["ଗାଉଁଲି ଝିଅ ପରି","ସବୁ ଶୁଣେ ନଈ","ଜହ୍ନ ରାତିରେ ବଉଳେ","ନୂଆଲୁଗା ପିନ୍ଧେ","ଲାଜରେ ମରିସରି","ଓଦା ଓଠରେ ଗୀତଗାଏ,","ଦରିଆକୁ ଡାକେ।"],["ମାଆ ଚଢ଼େଇ ପରି","ଆହୁରି ଡେଣା ମେଲାଏ ବରଗଛ","ପାକଳ ହୁଏ ସମୟ","ମାଟିରୁ ପଥର ହୁଏ ବେଦୀ","ହତଶୀରି ଗ୍ରାମଦେବୀ।"],["ଯେବେଠୁ ବଢିଲା କୋଳାହଳ","ଗହଳଚହଳ,ମଠ,ମନ୍ଦିର ଧୁନିଘର","ଭଜନ କୀର୍ତ୍ତନ ପ୍ରବଚନ","ବନ୍ଧତଳେ ବସା ବାନ୍ଧିଲେ ଧର୍ମବକ।"],["ନଈକୁ ନେଇ","ରଚିଲେ ରାସକ୍ରୀଡା ଭୋଗୀଏ","ଜାଲକୁ ଡେଣାକରି","ଡଙ୍ଗାମାନ ଉଡ଼ିଗଲେ","ବାରୁଣାବନ୍ତ, ବଣ ଛାତିରେ","ନିଆଁ ଜାଳି ଦେହ ସେକିଲେ","ସହରୀ ଜନ୍ତୁଏ।"],["ସମୟର କୁରାଢ଼ୀ ଚୋଟରେ","କୁଆଡେ ହଜିଗଲା ବରଗଛ","କାକଳି-କୁହାଟ","ନଷ୍ଟ ହୋଇଗଲା ସ୍ବର୍ଗ","ଧିରେ ଧିରେ।","⚫","ମାର୍ଫତ -•✓ କବି କୈଳାସ ରାୟ","ଆନିଳାଞ୍ଚଳ,ମାରୁତି ନଗର","ପୁରୀ -୨"]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]},"en":{"label":"English","title":"A Photograph of the Ruined Paradise They Speak Of","kind":"Translation","stanzas":[["In the southern corner of Gobari Pat,","where that shrimp enclosure is seen,","long ago there stood","a wood guarding the timid river.","Beyond it, a mound of bena grass;","on the mound, a banyan;","beneath the tree, the village goddess."],["Who knows who built there","the great earthen altar!","Placed clod upon clod of faith,","made a stone into a goddess,","made the strongman bow his head,","sang and danced, damming the wind,","and closed the five gates."],["Here, justice and judgement,","feasts, rice and merriment,","dance, spectacle, horse-dance,","herds of cattle, the washer's ghat,","boats and little boats, canopy nets,","evening and morning,","faces of laughter and despair,","blurred sketches of truth and lies.","From the wind's flute-note,","children hear the life of the wandering mind.","In the murmur the heart opens;","here one heart is knotted to another."],["Like a village girl,","the river hears it all,","bursts into blossom on moonlit nights,","puts on new cloth,","quite overcome with shyness,","sings with wet lips,","calls the sea."],["Like a mother bird,","the banyan spreads its wings wider.","Time ripens;","the earthen altar turns to stone;","the village goddess loses her grace."],["Ever since the clamour grew—","bustle, monasteries, temples, sacred-fire houses,","devotional songs, kirtan, sermons—","herons of false piety nested beneath the embankment."],["With the river,","the pleasure-seekers staged their rasa-play.","Making wings of nets,","the boats flew away.","Barunabanta—in the forest's breast,","lighting fires to warm their bodies,","the city beasts."],["Under the axe-blows of time,","where did the banyan vanish,","the birdsong and calls?","Paradise was ruined,","slowly, slowly.","⚫","Care of -•✓ Poet Kailash Ray,","Anilanchal, Maruti Nagar,","Puri - 2."]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]},"hi":{"label":"हिन्दी","title":"जिस उजड़े स्वर्ग की वे बात करते हैं, उसका छायाचित्र","kind":"Translation","stanzas":[["गोबरी पाट के दक्षिणी कोने में","जो झींगे का घेरा दिखता है,","बहुत पहले वहाँ था","डरपोक नदी की रखवाली करता वन।","उसके पार बेना घास का टीला,","टीले पर बरगद,","पेड़ के नीचे ग्रामदेवी।"],["जाने किसने वहाँ बनाया","मिट्टी का विशाल वेदीस्थल!","रखा ढेला-ढेला विश्वास,","पत्थर को देवी बनाया,","बाहुबली का सिर झुकाया,","हवा में बाँध बाँधकर गाया-नाचा,","पाँच द्वार बंद किए।"],["यहीं न्याय-फ़ैसले,","भोज-भात-मौज,","नाच, तमाशा, घोड़ा-नाच,","गायों के झुंड, धोबीघाट,","नावें, डोंगियाँ, चँदोवे-से जाल,","शाम-सवेरे,","हँसी-हताशा के चेहरे,","सच-झूठ का धुँधला चित्रण।","हवा की बाँसुरी के स्वर से","बच्चे बावरे मन का जीवन सुनते।","कलकल में हृदय खुलता,","यहीं मन से मन की गाँठ पड़ती।"],["गाँव की लड़की जैसी","नदी सब सुनती,","चाँदनी रात में बौराती,","नया वस्त्र पहनती,","लाज से मरी जाती,","गीले होंठों से गीत गाती,","समुद्र को बुलाती।"],["माँ चिड़िया की तरह","बरगद और पंख फैलाता।","समय पकता,","मिट्टी की वेदी पत्थर होती,","ग्रामदेवी श्रीहीन।"],["जब से कोलाहल बढ़ा—","चहल-पहल, मठ, मंदिर, धूनीघर,","भजन, कीर्तन, प्रवचन—","बाँध के नीचे धर्म-बगुलों ने बसेरे बनाए।"],["नदी को लेकर","भोगियों ने रासक्रीड़ा रची।","जालों को पंख बनाकर","नावें उड़ गईं।","बारुणावंत—वन की छाती में","आग जलाकर देह सेंकते","शहरी जानवर।"],["समय की कुल्हाड़ी के वार से","कहाँ खो गया बरगद,","कलरव और पुकारें?","स्वर्ग नष्ट हो गया,","धीरे-धीरे।","⚫","मार्फ़त -•✓ कवि कैलाश राय,","आनिलांचल, मारुति नगर,","पुरी - 2।"]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]}},"end_mark":"leaf","author":"Kamadev Moharana","route":"poem-340.html","portrait":"assets/writers/117-earth-voice-v1-64.webp","availability":""},{"id":98,"source_language":"or","variants":{"or":{"label":"ଓଡ଼ିଆ","title":"ଘନ ବେହେରାର ଗୀତ","kind":"Original","stanzas":[["ତାରା ଦେଖି ନଈକୁ ଯାଏ ଘନ।","ଯାଏ କହିଲେ ଉଡିଯାଏ","କୁହୁକ ଡାକ ମାରେ ମୁହାଣ।"],["ବାରେଣ୍ଡା ଭାଡ଼ିରେ ଶୋଲ, ଶୋଡୁଅ, କାତ","ଖେପା, ଖାଳେଇ, ଯୋତ","ଠଣାରୁ କାଢୁକାଢୁ ବିଡ଼ିକଠା, ଗୁଣ୍ଡିଡବା ମାଚିସି","କଥାରେ କଫ ଗୋଳେଇ ବୋଉ ଡାକେ -","ବା... ରେ.. ଘନ!","ରଜା ଅନ୍ଧ","ନିଆଁ ଆଉ ପାଣି","ହେଜୁଥିବୁ ଧନ!"],["ନେଲୁଟି ଭାତ?"],["କନ୍ଥା ଉପରେ","କେର଼ାଏ ଶୁଖିଲା ଡାଙ୍ଗ","ଥନଝୁଣେ ଏକୋଇର ବାଳ ବିଶିକେଶନ","ଡାକେ ପବନ ... ଘନ... ଘନ... ଘନ।"],["ସାଇ ଟପିଲେ ଦାଣ୍ଡ","ଦାଣ୍ଡ ସରିଲେ ବଣ","ବଣ ମଝିରେ ମଶାଣୀ।"],["ବହଳ ଅନ୍ଧାର","ତା ଠୁ ବହଳ ମଶାଣୀ-ନୀରବତା","ସେଇଠୁ ଉଠେ ଛାଇଟିଏ","ପଛ ଧରେ,ଗପ କୁହେ","ଜୀବନ ଆଉ ସଂଘର୍ଷର।"],["ନଈ ଆଉ ନାରୀ ପରି","ଥାଏ ଗୋଟିଏ ମାୟା ରେ ବାୟା","ସମୁଦ୍ରର!","ସେଠି ପବନ ପଙ୍କିଳ","ଲହରୀ ସର୍ପ ମାଳମାଳ","ନୀରବ ମହାକାଳ।"],["ଡୁଙ୍ଗିରେ ସ୍ବପ୍ନ ଥୋଇ","ବିଡିରେ ପୋଡେ ଦୁଃଖ","ଖୁଣ୍ଟରୁ ପଘା ଖୋଲି","ସୁମରି ମଙ୍ଗ ଦେବତୀ","ଅନ୍ଧାର ଭିତରେ ଓଠ ଲମ୍ବାଏ ଘନ -","ହେ ରାମ ଯେ ରଜା ପୁଅ","ଭାଇ ଲଇକ୍ଷଣ","ସୀତା ଯେ ସୁକୁମାରୀ","ଭ୍ରମେ ଘୋର ବନ","ମାୟାବୀ ମନ୍ଦମତି","ଦୈତ୍ୟ ଦଶାନନ","କପି ସେ ମହାବଳି","ବୀର ହନୁମାନ","ଭାରିଜା ମନ୍ଦୋଦରୀ","ଭାଇ ବିଭୀଷଣ","ଭଗିନୀ ସୃପଣଖା","ନାଶା-କର୍ଣ୍ଣ ହୀନ...."],["ନଈ ଡାକେ ଘନ....","ନାଆ କୁହାଟେ ଘନ","ହକାରେ ଦରିଆ ..ଘନ..ଘନ...ଘନ....।"]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]},"hi":{"label":"हिन्दी","title":"घन बेहरा का गीत","kind":"Translation","stanzas":[["तारे देखकर नदी को जाता है घन।","जाता क्या, उड़ जाता है","मुहाना जादू भरी पुकार लगाता है।"],["बरामदे के मचान पर शोल, शोडुआ, कात","खेपा, खालेई, जोत","ताक से बीड़ी का बंडल, तंबाकू की डिबिया और माचिस निकालते-निकालते","बातों में कफ़ मिलाकर माँ पुकारती है—","बेटा... रे... घन!","राजा अंधा है","आग और पानी","याद रखना, धन मेरे!"],["भात लिया न?"],["कथरी पर","सूखी टहनियों का गुच्छा","उछलता-कूदता इकलौता दुलारा बालक","हवा पुकारती है... घन... घन... घन।"],["टोला पार तो सड़क","सड़क ख़त्म तो वन","वन के बीच श्मशान।"],["गाढ़ा अँधेरा","उससे गाढ़ा श्मशान का मौन","वहीं से उठती है एक छाया","पीछे लगती है, कथा कहती है","जीवन और संघर्ष की।"],["नदी और स्त्री की तरह","एक ही माया में बावला रहता है","समुद्र की!","वहाँ हवा पंकिल है","लहरों के साँप कतारों में","निःशब्द महाकाल।"],["डोंगी में सपने रख","बीड़ी में दुख जलाता है","खूँटे से रस्सी खोल","नाव के अग्रभाग की देवी को स्मरता","अँधेरे में होंठ फैलाकर गाता है घन—","हे राम जो राजा के बेटे","भाई लक्ष्मण","सीता जो सुकुमारी","घोर वन में भटकते","मायावी, मंदमति","दैत्य दशानन","वानर वह महाबली","वीर हनुमान","पत्नी मंदोदरी","भाई विभीषण","बहन शूर्पणखा","नाक और कान से हीन...."],["नदी पुकारती है घन....","नाव हाँक लगाती है घन","समुद्र बुलाता है.. घन.. घन... घन....।"]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]},"en":{"label":"English","title":"Ghana Behera’s Song","kind":"Translation","stanzas":[["By the stars Ghana goes to the river.","Goes, did I say? He flies","the river mouth calls with enchantment."],["On the veranda rack: shola, shodua, kata","khepa, khalei, jota","as the bidi bundle, tobacco tin and matches come out of the niche","Mother calls, phlegm mingling with her words—","Son... O... Ghana!","The king is blind","fire and water—","remember them, my treasure!"],["Have you taken rice?"],["Upon the patched quilt","a bundle of dry twigs","the only darling child bounds about","the wind calls... Ghana... Ghana... Ghana."],["Beyond the hamlet, the road","beyond the road, the forest","in the forest, the cremation ground."],["Thick darkness","thicker still the cremation ground’s silence","from there a shadow rises","follows behind, tells stories","of life and struggle."],["Like the river and the woman","he is lost in a single enchantment—","the sea’s!","There the wind is muddy","waves are snakes in row upon row","silent, great Time."],["Setting dreams in the dinghy","he burns sorrow in a bidi","untying the rope from the post","remembering the goddess of the prow","Ghana stretches his lips into song in the dark—","O Rama, the king’s son","his brother Lakshmana","Sita, the tender maiden","wander in the fearsome forest","crafty, foolish","the demon Dashanana","the monkey of great strength","heroic Hanuman","wife Mandodari","brother Vibhishana","sister Shurpanakha","without nose or ears...."],["The river calls Ghana....","the boat cries out Ghana","the sea summons.. Ghana.. Ghana... Ghana...."]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]}},"end_mark":"paired","author":"Kamadev Moharana","route":"poem-98.html","portrait":"assets/writers/117-earth-voice-v1-64.webp","availability":""}]}
